---
// CTA Component for Help Chat Bot
---

<section class="cta-section">
  <!-- Interactive design blobs -->
  <div class="glow-effect" style="top: -20%; left: 30%; width: 500px; height: 500px; opacity: 0.15; background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(2, 158, 248, 0.25) 0%, rgba(6, 55, 186, 0.1) 60%, rgba(0,0,0,0) 100%);"></div>

  <div class="container">
    <div class="cta-card glass-card reveal-on-scroll">
      <div class="cta-content">
        <h2>Pronto para revolucionar o atendimento do seu negócio?</h2>
        <p>
          Fale com um especialista hoje mesmo. Nós desenhamos os fluxos de automação perfeitos para a sua clínica ou empresa, cuidamos de toda a integração e colocamos para rodar com rapidez.
        </p>

        <div class="cta-buttons">
          <a href="https://wa.me/5538998591036?text=Olá,%20vi%20o%20site%20e%20gostaria%20de%20um%20orçamento!" target="_blank" class="btn-whatsapp cta-btn">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 16 16">
              <path d="M13.601 2.326A7.85 7.85 0 0 0 7.994 0C3.627 0 .068 3.558.064 7.926c0 1.399.366 2.76 1.057 3.965L0 16l4.204-1.102a7.9 7.9 0 0 0 3.79.948h.008c4.368 0 7.927-3.559 7.931-7.928a7.9 7.9 0 0 0-2.332-5.593l-.004-.005zM7.994 14.52a6.57 6.57 0 0 1-3.356-.92l-.24-.144-2.494.654.666-2.433-.156-.251a6.56 6.56 0 0 1-1.007-3.505c0-3.626 2.957-6.584 6.591-6.584a6.56 6.56 0 0 1 4.66 1.931 6.56 6.56 0 0 1 1.928 4.66c-.004 3.639-2.961 6.592-6.592 6.592m3.69-4.29c-.2-.1-1.171-.578-1.349-.643-.178-.065-.307-.1-.439.1-.132.197-.508.643-.623.774-.115.13-.23.148-.43.048a5.9 5.9 0 0 1-1.602-1.012 6.2 6.2 0 0 1-1.109-1.397c-.12-.207-.013-.32.088-.42.09-.09.2-.234.3-.35.1-.117.133-.197.2-.33.067-.132.034-.249-.017-.35-.051-.1-.439-1.058-.6-.145-.158-.387-.343-.377-.49-.377-.113.001-.214.07-.306.182-.132.16-.395.428-.395.948 0 1.02.744 2.01 1.093 2.471.348.462 1.93 2.95 4.67 4.137.653.28 1.162.447 1.558.573.656.208 1.252.179 1.725.108.527-.078 1.17-.478 1.334-.94.164-.462.164-.858.115-.94-.049-.082-.18-.13-.38-.23"/>
            </svg>
            <span>Falar com um Especialista no WhatsApp</span>
          </a>
        </div>

        <div class="cta-meta-badge">
          <span>✓ Configuração rápida</span>
          <span>✓ Sem taxa de cancelamento</span>
          <span>✓ Parceiro Meta</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .cta-section {
    padding: 100px 0;
    background: var(--color-bg);
    transition: background-color 0.3s ease;
  }

  .cta-card {
    padding: 80px 40px;
    text-align: center;
    border-radius: var(--radius-xl);
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
  }

  .cta-card::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    top: 0;
    left: 0;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    background: radial-gradient(circle at center, rgba(6, 55, 186, 0.12) 0%, rgba(3, 7, 18, 0) 70%);
    z-index: 0;
  }

  .cta-content {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
    max-width: 800px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .cta-content h2 {
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 3rem);
    margin-bottom: 24px;
    line-height: 1.2;
  }

  .cta-content p {
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
    margin-bottom: 40px;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
  }

  .cta-buttons {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    margin-bottom: 30px;
  }

  .cta-btn {
    padding: 18px 36px;
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    box-shadow: 0 15px 35px rgba(3, 173, 61, 0.35);
  }

  .cta-meta-badge {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 24px;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .cta-card {
      padding: 50px 20px;
    }
    
    .cta-meta-badge {
      gap: 12px;
      flex-direction: column;
    }
  }
</style>
